          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 37,
            "text": "theorem admissible_iff {a b p₁ p₂ : ℝ} (ha : 0 < a)\n    (hv : 2 < shearMagnitude a b) :\n    AdmissibleCone a b p₁ p₂ ↔\n      shearMagnitude a b < parallelStress a b p₁ p₂ ∧\n        (shearMagnitude a b - 2) * transverseStress a b p₁ p₂ ^ 2 <\n          2 * (parallelStress a b p₁ p₂ - shearMagnitude a b) ^ 2"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
